        "created_at": "2015-03-13T23:33:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Now we're cookin' with gas:</p><p><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p>There are still a couple of minor tweaks I want to make before I post the file to my site, but I think it's looking pretty good. &nbsp;The dice jump out of the tray more than I'd like (maybe that third ramp I took out was to slow down the dice...), but I should be able to get things to a good place soon.</p>",
