      {
        "id": 115918,
        "name": "Spiff",
        "username": "Spiff",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-13T23:54:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"metlarcturus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/metlarcturus/48/2210_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> metlarcturus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Ooh, that's nice. How does the cardstock you're using hold up to repeated rolling?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Since I just made it an hour ago, I have no idea how it holds up. &nbsp;It doesn't seem like it takes much of a beating from just dropping dice through it, so my guess is that squishing it in boxes to store and move it will cause more damage than actually using it.</p>\n<p>I've only tried it with the official dice.</p>\n<p>I think I can alter the velocity of the dice through the tower by moving the top inner ramp lower. &nbsp;If that works, I'll be all set.</p>",
        "post_number": 26,
        "post_type": 1,
